# RFC-TRADECORE-0031 DECIDE_ON Overview Owner Work

## Plan

- 背景：consumer handoff要求overview最多8,000 anchors、detail最多4,000、overview/detail axis分離、event-time alignment、OHLC/OC candlestick與scenario atomic presentation；另有navigator selection越coverage boundary未發adjacent intent的回歸。
- 目標：建立generic PTCS Dynamic owner contract並完成最小實作／測試，不引入TradeCore scenario DU或第二套navigator。
- 假設：consumer可用既有完整`RuntimeSnapshot` candidate一次提交Document＋Data，並以runtime projection commit receipt等待畫面完成；若consumer只能分離Document/Patch，需另行決策。
- 步驟：1) baseline build/test；2) RFC-0033與RFC-0032 correction；3) Contracts 8,000 cap、explicit overview axis與validation；4) Renderer event-time overview mapping與boundary gesture correction；5) focused unit/browser gates；6) docs/version/package/consumer handoff；7) commit/push。
- 範圍：Contracts、Renderer及必要exact downstream；consumer repo唯讀。未經需求不改SPAA/TradeCore。
- 驗收：8,000接受／8,001拒絕；1K detail＋60K overview selection/stripe用event time；OHLC/OC且up綠/down紅；scenario candidate不partial publish；任何gesture越左右界各只送一個adjacent intent並暴露mode/outcome；focused suites與必要browser gate通過。
- 風險：overview/detail ordinal混用、snapshot與patch atomicity誤判、8,000資料造成main-thread regression、record field新增影響所有constructors。
- 停止條件：generic owner packages與Daedalus handoff可驗，或consumer atomic submission能力不成立而成為blocking決策。

